/// Provenance of a catalog row — `Permission`, `Role`, `RolePermission`
/// (#235). Decides what the catalog reconciler may do to the row: converge a
/// `System` row to the manifest, leave an `Admin` row alone and report its
/// drift, refuse to run over a `Plugin` row the manifest also claims.
enum PermissionOwner {
  System
  Admin
  Plugin
}
